#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Take a 20-question exam on the IBM Training site to test your skills in using a quantum computer, and receive a badge through Credly."
msgstr "Kumuha ng 20-katanungang exam sa IBM Training site para subukin ang iyong mga kasanayan sa paggamit ng quantum computer, at makatanggap ng badge sa pamamagitan ng Credly."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exam | Use a quantum computer today"
msgstr "Exam | Gumamit ng quantum computer ngayon"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exam and badge {#exam-and-badge}"
msgstr "Exam at badge {#exam-and-badge}"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![A square badge stating the name of this course, foundational level, and issued by IBM Quantum&reg;.](/learning/images/courses/use-a-qc-today/exam/badge.avif)\n"
msgstr "![A square badge stating the name of this course, foundational level, and issued by IBM Quantum&reg;.](/learning/images/courses/use-a-qc-today/exam/badge.avif)\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Post-course survey {#post-course-survey}"
msgstr "Post-course survey {#post-course-survey}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Congratulations on completing the \"Use a quantum computer today\" course by IBM&reg;!\n"
msgstr "Binabati kita sa pagkumpleto ng \"Use a quantum computer today\" course ng IBM&reg;!\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Test your knowledge {#test-your-knowledge}"
msgstr "Subukin ang iyong kaalaman {#test-your-knowledge}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "After completing the reading and activities in this course, click the button below to navigate to IBM Training, where you can take the badging exam for Use a quantum computer today.\n"
msgstr "Pagkatapos makumpleto ang pagbasa at mga aktibidad sa kursong ito, i-click ang button sa ibaba para pumunta sa IBM Training, kung saan maaari mong kunin ang badging exam para sa Use a quantum computer today.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The exam consists of 20 questions, and you must answer at least 16 correctly to pass. Upon receiving a passing score, your badge will automatically be sent to the email you used to register with IBM Training.\n"
msgstr "Binubuo ang exam ng 20 katanungan, at kailangan mong sagutin nang tama ang hindi bababa sa 16 para pumasa. Kapag nakakuha ka ng passing score, awtomatikong ipapadala ang iyong badge sa email na ginamit mo para mag-rehistro sa IBM Training.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Make sure you're ready to take the exam. If you don't receive a passing score in two attempts, the exam becomes temporarily locked.\n"
msgstr "Siguraduhing handa ka nang kunin ang exam. Kung hindi ka makakuha ng passing score sa dalawang pagsubok, pansamantalang ma-lo-lock ang exam.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<LaunchExamButton href=\"https://www.ibm.com/training/course/using-a-quantum-computer-DL46112G\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "NOTICE: IBM leverages the services of Credly, a third-party data processor authorized by IBM and located in the United States, to assist in the administration of the IBM Digital Badge program. In order to issue you an IBM Digital Badge, your personal information (name, email address, and badge earned) will be shared with Credly. You will receive an email notification from Credly with instructions for claiming the badge. Your personal information is used to issue your badge and for program reporting and operational purposes. IBM may share the personal information collected with IBM subsidiaries and third parties globally. It will be handled in a manner consistent with IBM privacy practices. The IBM Privacy Statement can be viewed [here](https://www.ibm.com/privacy/us/en/).\n"
msgstr "NOTICE: IBM leverages the services of Credly, a third-party data processor authorized by IBM and located in the United States, to assist in the administration of the IBM Digital Badge program. In order to issue you an IBM Digital Badge, your personal information (name, email address, and badge earned) will be shared with Credly. You will receive an email notification from Credly with instructions for claiming the badge. Your personal information is used to issue your badge and for program reporting and operational purposes. IBM may share the personal information collected with IBM subsidiaries and third parties globally. It will be handled in a manner consistent with IBM privacy practices. The IBM Privacy Statement can be viewed [here](https://www.ibm.com/privacy/us/en/).\n"
